00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:37.030
Moving out... What?!

00:19:39.230 --> 00:19:41.060
Lupe Cineau's Bruckeng?

00:19:43.130 --> 00:19:44.130
Out of the way!

00:19:57.330 --> 00:19:58.960
You're right, Boy.

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:03.160
