00:21:18.700 --> 00:21:21.200
Is that why "Guillotine Fuala" is here?

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:22.160
Yes.

00:21:33.400 --> 00:21:38.300
On the journey tabi no yukue no

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:42.630
In the flickering darkness yurameku yami ni
It was your first time,

00:21:42.630 --> 00:21:44.700
and you used it like a master!

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:46.600
Again?

